    "html":  "\u003cdiv class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/9/97/Hsien-Ko_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20241114132643\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"4 00px\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"4 00px\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/9/97/Hsien-Ko_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20241114132643\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"711\" height=\"1080\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Hsien-Ko .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Hsien-Ko_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eGhostly girl\u003c/b\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA human girl turned Darkstalker. She threw her humanity away with a forbidden technique called Igyo Tenshin to save her mother\u0027s soul that was trapped in darkness. Her sister Mei Ling is the fu paper in her jiangshi hat and serves to controls her powers.\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"f6bfd105b5c889820f97e00c72f3aad6\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Hsien-ko_Queen-s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:80px;\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Hsien-ko_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" title=\"Hsien-ko Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg (291 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:80px;\"\u003e\u003cnoscript\u003e\u003cimg style=\"\" src=\"https: